{
  "_": "Links of the design -> pages of the real site. Keys of `map` are what the design writes in href (the .dc.html files stand for design pages). A value is a docs page key (docs/<lang>/<key>.md, a language without the page gets the English one), `@main` / `@app` for the pages of the new site, or {key, heading} to jump to the heading number `heading` (## level) of a docs page: the anchor comes from the real heading, so it exists only where the page has it. `byText` refines by the Russian text of the link (\"text\") or of the link and the heading of its card (\"text|heading\"); a key ending in * matches a prefix. `page` is what the design calls data-page on the protocol buttons.",
